cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HCS Discovery Studio in research, please cite this software."
title: "HCS Discovery Studio"
abstract: >-
  A local-first, open-source workbench for AI-assisted drug-discovery research.
  It imports compound libraries, runs reproducible CPU workflows with recorded
  provenance, and exposes the same operations through a React UI, a headless
  CLI and a versioned HTTP API.
